{"id":"pokhozhe","lemma":"похоже","pos":"adv","rank":148,"glosses":["it seems, apparently, it looks (as if)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fa/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%85%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%85%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это очень похоже.","en":"It's very similar.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Он, похоже, нас знает.","en":"He seems to know us.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"us","l":"мы"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"}]},{"text":"На что это будет похоже?","en":"What's it going to be like?","words":[{"g":"on / at"},null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"why"]]},{"text":"Похоже, дома никого нет.","en":"It looks like no one's home.","words":[null,{"g":"at home"},null,{"g":"no / there isn't"}]},{"text":"Похоже, тебе нужна помощь.","en":"It looks like you need help.","words":[null,{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"help, assistance, aid"}]}]}